XFAIL: system-linux, system-darwin

A child that dies abnormally (abort) is not reported to its parent as
having succeeded, so a build does not continue past a crashed compiler.
Known failures: #119 (a signal death is reported as exit 0).

RUN: %e2e probe abort | FileCheck %s
RUN: %catter script::cdb -q -o %t.json -- %e2e probe abort | FileCheck %s

CHECK: PASS abort
